NOTICE

Model weights produced by the transplant pipeline in this repository are
derived from the DNSMOS P.835 model `sig_bak_ovr.onnx` published by
Microsoft in the DNS-Challenge repository
(https://github.com/microsoft/DNS-Challenge), licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Attribution: "DNSMOS P.835: A non-intrusive perceptual objective speech
quality metric to evaluate noise suppressors", C. K. A. Reddy, V. Gopal,
R. Cutler (Microsoft Corporation). Weights redistributed/derived under
CC BY 4.0; changes: conversion to PyTorch state_dict layout and derived
ONNX exports (quantized and gradient-augmented variants).
